          "pyqs": "PYQ-STYLE PRACTICE 1\nQ. Which option is most directly associated with “Experimental-analytical paradigm”?\nA. None of the above\nB. Experimental-analytical paradigm\nC. Logical empiricism\nD. Crisis in psychology\nAnswer: Experimental-analytical paradigm\nNote: Generated from the source framework; this is PYQ-style practice, not a verified past-year question.\n\nPYQ-STYLE PRACTICE 2\nQ. Which option is most directly associated with “Logical empiricism”?\nA. Crisis in psychology\nB. None of the above\nC. Logical empiricism\nD. Experimental-analytical paradigm\nAnswer: Logical empiricism\nNote: Generated from the source framework; this is PYQ-style practice, not a verified past-year question.",
