          "flashcards": "Q: What is Basic reinforcement variables?\nA: characteristics that can take different values and structure research designs\nQ: Key points for Basic reinforcement variables\nA: independent; dependent; extraneous; control\nQ: What is Reinforcement schedules?\nA: fixed/variable and ratio/interval schedules that determine when reinforcement occurs\nQ: Key points for Reinforcement schedules\nA: FR; FI; VR; VI",
          "references": "",
