          "pyqs": "PYQ-STYLE PRACTICE 1\nQ. Which option is most directly associated with “Social perception”?\nA. Communication\nB. Attributions\nC. Attitude\nD. Social perception\nAnswer: Social perception\nNote: Generated from the source framework; this is PYQ-style practice, not a verified past-year question.\n\nPYQ-STYLE PRACTICE 2\nQ. Which option is most directly associated with “Communication”?\nA. Attitude\nB. Communication\nC. Social perception\nD. Attributions\nAnswer: Communication\nNote: Generated from the source framework; this is PYQ-style practice, not a verified past-year question.",
